										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><em>This article was Human Written by News Reporter.</em></p>
<p>If you&#8217;re doing some LEGO shopping for the holidays, here are some of the best deals you can currently find on <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a>. Remember that prices may change at any time.</p>
<p>Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don’t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in Canada!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</p>
<p>1. <span id="productTitle" class="a-size-medium product-title-word-break">LEGO Minecraft The Creeper 21276 &#8211; 40</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">% off (Regular $49.99, on sale for $29.86)</span></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now at Official Site:</strong> <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-96722" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Minecraft-21276-The-Creeper-Summer-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="864" height="856" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Minecraft-21276-The-Creeper-Summer-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 864w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Minecraft-21276-The-Creeper-Summer-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x297.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Minecraft-21276-The-Creeper-Summer-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Minecraft-21276-The-Creeper-Summer-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x761.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 864px) 100vw, 864px" /></p>
<p>2. <span id="productTitle" class="a-size-large product-title-word-break">LEGO Star Wars Imperial Star Destroyer 75394 &#8211; 20</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">% off (Regular $209.99, on sale for $167.99)</span></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now at Official Site:</strong> <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-89430" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Disney-LEGO-Star-Wars-75394-Imperial-Star-Destroyer-Summer-August-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="1108" height="814" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Disney-LEGO-Star-Wars-75394-Imperial-Star-Destroyer-Summer-August-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 1108w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Disney-LEGO-Star-Wars-75394-Imperial-Star-Destroyer-Summer-August-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x220.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Disney-LEGO-Star-Wars-75394-Imperial-Star-Destroyer-Summer-August-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x752.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Disney-LEGO-Star-Wars-75394-Imperial-Star-Destroyer-Summer-August-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x564.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1108px) 100vw, 1108px" /></p>
<p>3. <span id="productTitle" class="a-size-large product-title-word-break">LEGO Star Wars: Andor K-2SO Security Droid 75434 &#8211; 33</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">% off (Regular $119.99, on sale for $79.86)</span></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now at Official Site:</strong> <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-95996" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/18-LEGO-Star-Wars-75434-K-2SO-Security-Droid-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="600" height="874" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/18-LEGO-Star-Wars-75434-K-2SO-Security-Droid-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 600w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/18-LEGO-Star-Wars-75434-K-2SO-Security-Droid-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-206x300.jpg 206w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" /></p>
