<p>One of my favorites is the Secret Potions Classroom, as it&#8217;s great for both display and play. You can display the cauldron itself to show off your fandom of the franchise, or open it up to reveal the secret classroom and play with the two included minifigures.</p>
<p>I also like the Tranquil Garden and Autumn Cottage Garden sets, as they&#8217;re full of stunning colors, feature beautiful details, and let you customize the display to your liking and in a way that best fits your space.</p>
<p>For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
