<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">Crowds, Seasons, and Events</span></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">There’s bound to be crowds where there is fun, especially for kids. And trust me when I say that <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND New York</a> has it all when it comes to theme park rides and attractions. It might not be as extensive as <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND California</a> with its water park and the SEA Life Aquarium, but you won’t feel left out.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">I’m not a crowd person, but I’m not going to box everyone into my preference. If you love the crowd energy, then the best time to visit <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND New York</a> will be:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><b>Summer vacation (June to August)</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">: As you’ve guessed already, this is when parents typically schedule trips to the resort for their kids. The children will be on holiday, making this period the longest stretch of peak operations for the resort.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><b>Spring break (Mid-March to April):</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> It’s a relatively short period, but people do turn up in large numbers. March is when the resort typically opens, coinciding with the Spring Break across New York, New Jersey, and neighboring states. As such, you can expect people to pour in with their kids for a short trip.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><b>Holidays</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">: Some parents don’t wait for the summer vacation or until the Spring Break to take their kids to the park. Instead, they drop in during one- or few-day holidays. Think about holidays like Columbus Day or July 4th.</span></li>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book Hotel Stays at Official LEGOLAND Theme Parks Site &amp; See All Promotions: </strong><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">California, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Florida, US</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New York, US</a></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Weekends are a blast when it comes to having crowds at the resort. Provided the park is open, you will always find people on weekends. And if you are not careful enough, you’d be stuck in long waiting lines for rides and attractions.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">I know some people who’d prefer a 2-day itinerary on a weekend instead of planning a special vacation. And for those in the city, it’s a quick breeze in, breeze out situation.</span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-112169 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGOLAND-New-York-Jays-Gravity-Force-Trainer-Junior-Driving-School-and-Factory-Adventure-Ride-Banner-Logo-Feature-Attractions.jpg" alt="" width="924" height="595" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGOLAND-New-York-Jays-Gravity-Force-Trainer-Junior-Driving-School-and-Factory-Adventure-Ride-Banner-Logo-Feature-Attractions.jpg 924w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGOLAND-New-York-Jays-Gravity-Force-Trainer-Junior-Driving-School-and-Factory-Adventure-Ride-Banner-Logo-Feature-Attractions-300x193.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/LEGOLAND-New-York-Jays-Gravity-Force-Trainer-Junior-Driving-School-and-Factory-Adventure-Ride-Banner-Logo-Feature-Attractions-768x495.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 924px) 100vw, 924px" /></p>
<h3><span style="font-weight: 400;">Events That Bring Crowds</span></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">For the most collective fun with other kids, the best time to visit <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND New York</a> is during the event periods. You’ll find several seasonal events, and the one for the Christmas Holiday is the Bricktacular.</span></p>
<h4><span style="font-weight: 400;">Holiday Bricktacular</span></h4>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-113868 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGOLAND-Christmas-Bricktacular-Holiday-Winter-California-Banner-Logo.gif" alt="" width="960" height="640" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This event is scheduled to run from November 27, 2026 to January 2, 2027. Some of the locations the event will cover include the theme park, Brick Street, Bricktopia, LEGO NINJAGO World, and Miniland. I couldn’t be happier that one of my favorite spots, Miniland, is among them.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">During Bricktacular, the resort will transform into a winter wonderland, but it doesn’t end there. You’ll find dazzling lights, exclusive holiday builds, and festive shows. On the side, now might be the best time to pick up </span><a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/8-best-lego-sets-for-the-holidays-and-christmas-2026-under-100/"><span style="font-weight: 400;">LEGO sets for the Christmas holiday</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Meet-and-greets are another integral part of this event, along with seasonal treats. If you love holiday shows, then you won’t want your kids to miss this event.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You and your kids can try out Glice skating across the resort’s winter tink–not me, though; I think I’m getting too old for all that fun.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Also, if your kids want to meet LEGO Santa and also write letters to Santa, this period is the best time to visit the resort.</span></p>
