<h4><span style="font-weight: 400;">LEGO Festival</span></h4>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-108734 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGOLAND-Festival-Zones-Music-Creative-Chill-Out-California-US-Resort.jpg" alt="" width="960" height="335" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGOLAND-Festival-Zones-Music-Creative-Chill-Out-California-US-Resort.jpg 960w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGOLAND-Festival-Zones-Music-Creative-Chill-Out-California-US-Resort-300x105.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGOLAND-Festival-Zones-Music-Creative-Chill-Out-California-US-Resort-768x268.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Even if you’d miss other events, try not to miss the LEGO Festival. It typically comes up during late spring, although the resort is yet to publish information on the schedule. But when that happens, note that it will be your best time to visit <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND New York</a> for the full LEGO experience.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The LEGO Festival typically spans several weekends. During this period, you’ll find building challenges, music, play zones, live shows, and character meet-and-greets. It is one of the most fun-filled periods in LEGOLAND Resorts across the United States.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">While the LEGO Festival brings LEGO-based fun, it comes at the cost of large crowds and waiting lines. If you want to have a quiet tour of the resort with your kids, this isn’t the best time to visit.</span></p>
