		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=115193</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1200" height="848" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Christmas-Craft-Set-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Early-Pre-Black-Friday-Promotion.webp" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Christmas Craft Set GWP Gift with Purchase November 2026 Early Pre-Black Friday Promotion" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Christmas-Craft-Set-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Early-Pre-Black-Friday-Promotion.webp 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Christmas-Craft-Set-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Early-Pre-Black-Friday-Promotion-300x212.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Christmas-Craft-Set-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Early-Pre-Black-Friday-Promotion-1024x724.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Christmas-Craft-Set-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Early-Pre-Black-Friday-Promotion-768x543.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>LEGO (USA &#124; Canada &#124; UK &#124; Australia) has started some Early Pre-Black Friday 2026 GWP, Promotions &#38; Sales. Insiders Rewards Membership is required</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-early-pre-black-friday-2026-gwp-promotions-sales-november-23-26-2026/">LEGO Early Pre-Black Friday 2026 GWP, Promotions &#038; Sales: November 23-26, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>) has started some Early Pre-Black Friday 2026 GWP, Promotions &amp; Sales. Insiders Rewards Membership is required for quite a few of these promotions. The Insiders program is free to join. Let&#8217;s dive right in to the offers.</p>
<p>Don&#8217;t miss out on any future LEGO News &amp; Deals by following us.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer mobile device real time push notifications for our LEGO Deals &amp; News, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Whatsapp Channel</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Discord Channel</a>.</p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">LEGO Christmas Craft Set GWP Gift with Purchase</span></h3>
<p>First up is the LEGO Christmas Craft Set GWP Gift with Purchase. This gift set will be free when you spend $75 USD / $100 CAD / £70 GBP / $120 AUD or more on either LEGO City, Classic, Friends, Creator 3in1 or Ninjago themed items at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). Available for LEGO Insiders only from November 23-26, 2026.</p>
<ul>
