										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Hey everybody, Agent Ice here&#8230;</p>
<p>I just received some Top Secret Intelligence info for Toys N Bricks that you may all want to know about. Check it out below and keep it a secret.</p>
<p>I wish you good luck and every success in your mission objective agents. <span class="ipsEmoji" title="smiling face with sunglasses">&#x1f60e;</span><span class="ipsEmoji" title="smiling face with sunglasses">&#x1f60e;</span><span class="ipsEmoji" title="smiling face with sunglasses">&#x1f60e;</span></p>
<p><a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-115183 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Forum-Classified-Restricted-Access-Forum-Registration-Log-In-Toysnbricks-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="825" height="659" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Forum-Classified-Restricted-Access-Forum-Registration-Log-In-Toysnbricks-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Forum-Classified-Restricted-Access-Forum-Registration-Log-In-Toysnbricks-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Forum-Classified-Restricted-Access-Forum-Registration-Log-In-Toysnbricks-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 825px) 100vw, 825px" /></a></p>
<p>Anybody remember the LEGO Agents Theme from 2008 to 2009? <span class="ipsEmoji" title="upside-down face">&#x1f643;</span></p>
<p>Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don’t miss out on any other LEGO News and Sales &amp; Deals!</p>
