		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=115180</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1200" height="1200" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Fortnite-77082-Rave-Cave-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Fortnite 77082 Rave Cave Summer June 2026 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Fortnite-77082-Rave-Cave-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Fortnite-77082-Rave-Cave-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Fortnite-77082-Rave-Cave-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Fortnite-77082-Rave-Cave-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Fortnite-77082-Rave-Cave-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>Good Morning Everyone &#8211; Happy Sunday! Amazon US currently has lots of awesome LEGO deals for today. I</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/29-handpicked-verified-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-this-morning-november-22-2026/">29 Handpicked &#038; Verified Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for This Morning, November 22, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Morning Everyone &#8211; Happy Sunday! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has lots of awesome LEGO deals for today. I believe they price matched it from a lot of the other retailers deals which we reported in our earlier sales &amp; deals articles. Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, Amazon prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p>One of my top pick deals would probably be the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Fortnite-Rave-Cave-Minifigures/dp/B0G2SZXVHB?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=e46a5b7e9ca08f8ccd6f2f480f6f39ea&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Fortnite Rave Cave 77082</a> at 40% off for <strong>$137.99</strong> (reg.$229.99).</p>
