										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-90771 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21351-Disney-Tim-Burtons-The-Nightmare-Before-Christmas-September-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="872" height="703" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21351-Disney-Tim-Burtons-The-Nightmare-Before-Christmas-September-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 1675w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21351-Disney-Tim-Burtons-The-Nightmare-Before-Christmas-September-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x242.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21351-Disney-Tim-Burtons-The-Nightmare-Before-Christmas-September-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x825.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21351-Disney-Tim-Burtons-The-Nightmare-Before-Christmas-September-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x619.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21351-Disney-Tim-Burtons-The-Nightmare-Before-Christmas-September-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-1536x1238.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 872px) 100vw, 872px" /></p>
<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=53843&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.scheels.com%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Scheels US</a> is a major sporting goods retail chain with over 30 stores in the United States. They have now started their LEGO Black Friday Sale Event 2026. Deals run from November 22-30, 2026 or while supplies last. There are <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=53843&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.scheels.com%2Fc%2Fall%2Fb%2Flego%3Fr%3DpromotionalSale%253Atrue" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over 15 LEGO sets discounted</a> for the <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=53843&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.scheels.com%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Scheels US</a> LEGO Black Friday 2026. A lot of the sets are also retiring soon too.</p>
<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=53843&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.scheels.com%2Fc%2Fall%2Fb%2Flego%3Fr%3DpromotionalSale%253Atrue" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-115177 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Scheels-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Sales-List.jpg" alt="" width="693" height="899" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Scheels-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Sales-List.jpg 693w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Scheels-US-LEGO-Black-Friday-Deals-2026-Sales-List-231x300.jpg 231w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 693px) 100vw, 693px" /></a></p>
